                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
                        "entry_id": "aea7ef13-8db8-3022-adb1-ee0ed7a80651",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полит. участник или организатор интервенции; тот, кто вторгается на чужую (суверенную) территорию"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "835bc784-41a5-4498-ad63-653eb10f354f",
                                "sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
                                "text": "Он смерил Берлиоза взглядом, как будто собирался сшить ему костюм, сквозь зубы пробормотал что-то вроде: «Раз, два… Меркурий во втором доме… луна ушла… шесть — несчастье… вечер — семь…» — и громко и радостно объявил: — Вам отрежут голову! — А кто именно? Враги? Интервенты? — Нет, — ответил собеседник, — русская женщина, комсомолка."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abaa15fb-e8d8-4e99-80ce-07c241a0e313",
                                "sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
                                "text": "В апреле 1937 года в течение нескольких часов авиация интервентов почти совершенно уничтожила в Испании цветущий город Гернику — старейшую столицу страны басков."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2645167-e4bb-45a0-bbb2-9eefe57e4a4c",
                                "sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
                                "text": "Он гордился своим политическим прошлым и был, кажется, искренне уверен, что если бы не он, партизанское движение на Амуре было бы подорвано в самом начале и Дальний Восток навсегда остался бы в руках интервентов и белых."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ecc568e-b6d3-41a6-8e9a-ffcf356ba85f",
                        "source_entry_id": "aea7ef13-8db8-3022-adb1-ee0ed7a80651",
                        "source_sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
                        "target_lang_word": "invader",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "invader",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "921598c2-3efb-3c25-8858-46a571e8521e",
                                        "entry_id": "8f0ace7b-9674-3362-b957-10982447b6bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who invades a region."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffc73d12-7057-4e83-8575-9a24cd380cea",
                                                "sense_id": "921598c2-3efb-3c25-8858-46a571e8521e",
                                                "text": "He remarks on the growth of the pretensions of the invaders since the treaty between Alfred and Guthrum which put the Northern warriors only on the same level as the twelf[-]hyndmen, or ordinary thegns."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50d4d635-3d08-462b-bce8-245429a60055",
                                                "sense_id": "921598c2-3efb-3c25-8858-46a571e8521e",
                                                "text": "The underroot tendril! We are at fault for giving the invader a path to Lady Brianna."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "146206c6-fefb-3805-8034-d4fc6eaaca1b",
                                        "entry_id": "8f0ace7b-9674-3362-b957-10982447b6bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An intruder (especially on someone's privacy)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a479a692-7c55-418c-8706-935584602883",
                        "source_entry_id": "aea7ef13-8db8-3022-adb1-ee0ed7a80651",
                        "source_sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
                        "target_lang_word": "interventionist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "interventionist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "537bd276-0bb2-325a-86e9-4b4a7c8d225c",
                                        "entry_id": "b4bc0216-6cd0-32bd-97b6-3d7d89305e85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to interventionism, or an advocate thereof."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a53fb7f6-d0f8-41ce-877f-f5285990d57f",
                                                "sense_id": "537bd276-0bb2-325a-86e9-4b4a7c8d225c",
                                                "text": "I don't believe in an interventionist God / But I know, darling, that you do / But if I did, I would kneel down and ask Him / Not to intervene when it came to you"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b78985d6-df76-474f-b9ac-e418457b39fa",
                                                "sense_id": "537bd276-0bb2-325a-86e9-4b4a7c8d225c",
                                                "text": "And the liberal blogosphere has long labeled Clinton part of the neoconservative wing, a conservative intellectual movement that supports an interventionist foreign policy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "interventionist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e49227fd-ab30-3c61-a52b-462553e7bc91",
                                        "entry_id": "d09d9f0d-12e0-331c-a3e7-bd09d7041b00",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who practices or defends interventionism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3312617a-fc0b-42b3-9f95-8c20c24e22f3",
                                                "sense_id": "e49227fd-ab30-3c61-a52b-462553e7bc91",
                                                "text": "The liberal interventionists and neoconservatives who have accused the administration of failing to lead never laid out an effective case as to what the relationship between U.S. military action and the political end state in Syria would be."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "014ad8f0-1b79-450c-9b47-56e9fedcfcea",
                                                "sense_id": "e49227fd-ab30-3c61-a52b-462553e7bc91",
                                                "text": "Senior players were sceptical to begin with, startled by Conte’s aggressively interventionist training sessions, practice constantly stopped by that barking voice, points of positional detail brutally drilled."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "987aad0a-edff-4e6e-b758-69ffb44822c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "aea7ef13-8db8-3022-adb1-ee0ed7a80651",
                        "source_sense_id": "3f9da95b-7425-32f5-bf72-f3e08c40150b",
